{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-17","level":"B1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Essen und Trinken 1","bn":"খাবার ও পানীয় ১"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Zum ___ gibt es Eis. (ডেজার্ট)","answers":["Nachtisch"],"options":["Nachtisch","Braten","Backofen"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Kuchen ist im ___. (ওভেন)","answers":["Backofen"],"options":["Backofen","Nachtisch","Unterschied"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich kaufe Fleisch beim ___. (কসাই)","answers":["Metzger"],"options":["Metzger","Bäcker","Ernährungsberater"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Was ist der ___ zwischen Quark und Käse? (পার্থক্য)","answers":["Unterschied"],"options":["Unterschied","Wunsch","Betrag"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bitte noch etwas Salz und ___. (গোলমরিচ)","answers":["Pfeffer"],"options":["Pfeffer","Schinken","Quark"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die Kinder trinken gern ___. (ফলের রস)","answers":["Fruchtsaft"],"options":["Fruchtsaft","Fruchtjoghurt","Kartoffelsalat"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die ___ von diesem Brot ist sehr gut. (গুণমান)","answers":["Qualität"],"options":["Qualität","Spezialität","Backware"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Biryani ist eine ___ aus Bangladesch. (বিশেষত্ব)","answers":["Spezialität"],"options":["Spezialität","Qualität","Backware"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-17-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich koche viel Gemüse, ___ gesund zu essen.","answers":["um"],"options":["um","damit","falls"],"promptBn":"একই কর্তা: um … zu","id":"b1-practice-17-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich koche viel Gemüse